    "RemoteCrab can stream your iPhone's microphone to your Mac. This is optional — toggle it off in the camera screen anytime.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab can stream your iPhone's microphone to your Mac. This is optional — toggle it off in the camera screen anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 可将 iPhone 麦克风串流到 Mac。此功能可选，随时可在相机页面关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RemoteCrab drives your Mac's cursor and keyboard from your iPhone — macOS requires the Accessibility permission for that. This step can't be skipped: without it, the trackpad and keyboard don't work.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab drives your Mac's cursor and keyboard from your iPhone — macOS requires the Accessibility permission for that. This step can't be skipped: without it, the trackpad and keyboard don't work."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 需要从 iPhone 控制 Mac 的光标和键盘——macOS 要求授予辅助功能权限。此步骤不可跳过：没有它，触控板和键盘无法工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RemoteCrab installs a small camera extension so FaceTime, Zoom, Photo Booth, OBS and other apps can select “RemoteCrab Camera”. macOS asks you to approve it once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab installs a small camera extension so FaceTime, Zoom, Photo Booth, OBS and other apps can select “RemoteCrab Camera”. macOS asks you to approve it once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 会安装一个小型相机扩展，FaceTime、Zoom、Photo Booth、OBS 等 App 即可选择「RemoteCrab Camera」。macOS 会要求你批准一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RemoteCrab is running": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab is running"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 正在运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RemoteCrab needs to use your camera, microphone, and local network. We only ever send data to your Mac — nothing leaves your WiFi.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab needs to use your camera, microphone, and local network. We only ever send data to your Mac — nothing leaves your WiFi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 需要使用摄像头、麦克风和本地网络。数据只会发送到你的 Mac，不会离开你的 WiFi。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RemoteCrab streams over your local WiFi using Bonjour. No data ever leaves your network.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab streams over your local WiFi using Bonjour. No data ever leaves your network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 通过 Bonjour 在本地 WiFi 上传输，数据不会离开你的网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RemoteCrab turns your iPhone into a camera, microphone, trackpad and keyboard for this Mac. This short setup grants what macOS needs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab turns your iPhone into a camera, microphone, trackpad and keyboard for this Mac. This short setup grants what macOS needs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 将你的 iPhone 变成这台 Mac 的摄像头、麦克风、触控板和键盘。本向导将完成 macOS 所需的授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RemoteCrab turns your iPhone's camera into a high-quality webcam for your Mac. We use it in real time — nothing is recorded or uploaded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab turns your iPhone's camera into a high-quality webcam for your Mac. We use it in real time — nothing is recorded or uploaded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 将你的 iPhone 摄像头变成 Mac 的高质量摄像头，实时使用，不录制、不上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RemoteCrab uses Bonjour to find your Mac on the same WiFi. Without this, the two devices can't talk to each other.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab uses Bonjour to find your Mac on the same WiFi. Without this, the two devices can't talk to each other."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RemoteCrab 使用 Bonjour 在同一 WiFi 上查找你的 Mac。没有此权限，两台设备无法通信。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
